      "message": "No upstream discussion yet. The legacy LRU direct reclaim path has\ntwo inefficiencies we observed on production devices: shrink_lruvec()\ncontinues scanning even after the reclaim target is met, causing\nover-reclaim, and shrink_node_memcgs() walks nearly-empty memcgs\nwith zero scan targets, wasting CPU cycles. We needed a near-term\nsolution via vendor hooks to address these under tight project\ntimelines.",
